OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns county will not benefit
OL,4,Afrom #2 bus cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FHerefordshire's two largest bus
OL,7,Foperators have not yet committed to the
OL,8,Fflat #2 fare being urged by the
OL,9,Fgovernment, according to council
OL,10,Fbosses.
OL,12,FLedbury councillor Justine Peberdy said
OL,13,Fthe price cap scheme "will not benefit
OL,14,FHerefordshire unless our operators
OL,15,Fchoose to participate in it".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
