OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1790160962
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns county will not benefit
OL,4,Afrom #2 bus cap
OL,5,
OL,6,FYeomans Travel and Sargeants Brothers,
OL,7,Fwho between them operate a majority of
OL,8,Fthe county's services, did not
OL,9,Fparticipate in the current #3 bus fare
OL,10,Fand there were concerns they would not
OL,11,Fparticipate in the new scheme, she
OL,12,Fsaid. Yeomans has said it was waiting
OL,13,Ffor more information before deciding.
OL,15,FThe bus fare cap in England will revert
OL,16,Fto #2, from the current #3 from
OL,17,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
